    "updated_at": "2024-12-11T02:59:17Z",
    "body": "> So we can't rely on the URL blob entry being null if only the blob is set, so should be treated like perhaps in the [URL origin serialization](https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#origin) steps\r\n\r\nI don't understand this sentence, or the suggestion. What do you think of my proposed change? Are you suggesting we should fall back to a different origin if the blob URL entry is null?\r\n\r\nIf so, I think we'll need @recvfrom's help, as this is getting beyond a simple null-dereference fix.",
